  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0 First stable release. Bundles apex-grid 3.3.0 (with dependencies) as a self-contained ES module. Typed ApexGrid<TItem> with sorting, filtering, quick filter, pagination, and selection; inline editing with undo/redo; column pin/reorder/resize; row pinning and reordering; tree data and master-detail expansion; JSON state persistence (getState/setState/getSchema); and strongly-typed callbacks for all 27 grid events.",
